WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:07.040
Yoshimori and the others were barely
able to fend off the Kokuboro,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.940
even at the cost of Shishio's life.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.940
Yoshimori swore to defeat Kaguro,
the one who took Shishio's life.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:25.050
But the Kokuboro have
started enacting a new plan

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.680
to take over Karasumori.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:34.700
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.560
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:41.770
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.670
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.110
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:51.510
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:55.050
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:58.390
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:04.050
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.560
Sha la la la la...

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:14.970
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.940
(Secret romance)

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:22.140
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:23.910
(A strange distance)

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:30.750
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:31.820
Yeah

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.290
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:38.890
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:44.230
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.870
Shishio... I'll defeat Kaguro!

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.710
To do that, I have to
go to Kokuboro,

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:28.400
but how do I get there?!

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.330
Damn it!

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:53.030
Oh, my.
You don't have to do that.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.790
This is nothing.
Please let me help.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.570
Such a well-made Shikigami.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.010
Oh, thank you.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:13.590
Excuse me!

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:14.650
Uh, Shikigami-san?

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.060
Welcome back.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.190
Grandma!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.660
I'm back.

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:35.270
I would've prepared
enough for three

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.400
if I knew you were
coming home...

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:40.080
But I'm glad I made extra.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:43.110
I'm sorry to trouble you,

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.910
but I had a little something
on the way.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:50.020
I'm sure you can manage
a bite or two more.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.320
Then I'll have just a little.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.560
What is with this conversation?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.530
It's like a soap opera about
a wife and mother-in-law...

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.830
But I must leave soon.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.000
What? You're going again?

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.270
Yes. I've done
the preliminary research.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.080
I'm probably leaving the day
after tomorrow

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.070
when my tools are ready.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:13.140
The day after tomorrow?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.910
You seem to be very busy.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.520
I wanted to see
what was happening here, too.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.950
Did anything happen
while I was gone?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.220
The Kokuboro attacked Karasumori...

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.620
...and Gen-kun was...

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.530
I'm sorry about what
happened to Shishio-san.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:45.810
What? Grandma Toki is back
from the Black Pampas Grass?

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:47.810
Yeah, she came back
late this afternoon.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.640
Did she barge into
that Monster Fox's castle?

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.580
No. She didn't go that far yet...

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:54.680
Oh...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.460
But Grandma says
she's going there

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:58.790
the day after tomorrow.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.000
I don't know if I should
tell you this

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.160
so keep it a secret.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.620
Y-Yeah...

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:09.690
Grandma is trying to
make a passage to Kokuboro.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:14.370
But she says it's really hard
to do without being detected...

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.610
I wonder if she'll be okay.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:22.020
I'm in no position to tell
Grandma what to do,

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:24.280
but I'm still worried.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.920
You know Bunny...

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.490
She does whatever she
sets her mind to.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.730
Who's Bunny?

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.290
Honey's grandma is Bunny.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.220
I shouldn't have asked...

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:42.470
It takes a lot of power to open up
a path to the Other World.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.070
Even skilled casters will
have a hard time.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:49.510
Honey, you can't go with her

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:52.040
because you have to
protect Karasumori, right?

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.510
Yeah, I know...

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:59.250
The passage to Kokuboro... huh?

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:37.550
It was very delicious.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:39.560
Thank you very much.

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.140
The pattern on that cup
has a strong connection

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.410
to the Other World.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.940
Did you know that?

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:00.840
Huh?

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.990
The founder of Hazama Style
Kekkai Techniques,

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:07.790
Tokimori-sama, began protecting
the Karasumori Site

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:11.450
around the same time
tea ceremonies were established.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.260
About 400 years ago.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.670
Bridges, umbrellas, baskets,
plovers, wheels,

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:20.360
dried persimmons and hedges.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.900
They were often used for
the patterns on pottery.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:26.310
That is because many of them
embodied gods, or something sacred.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:31.010
Some depicted the boundaries
to the Other World.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:35.250
Rivers that seem ordinary
are also a type of boundary.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.950
Even darkness below a bridge
is the boundary

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.750
between this world and another.

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.020
Entrances to the Other World
are hidden in those places.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.990
Since pottery comes in contact
with people's mouths...

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:49.550
...perhaps the intention was
to purify the pottery,

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:51.930
and attract luck
with the patterns.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.500
Did the founder enjoy
tea ceremonies, too?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:01.140
I don't know, but...

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:01.770
Huh?

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.970
You seem to have too much energy.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:07.350
You should participate in
more tea ceremony lessons

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:10.580
and become more ladylike.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.260
The dangers of the Other World
can only be understood

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.590
by those who have gone there.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:26.130
There is nothing more fearsome
than the unknown, or the unnoticed.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.180
Where do you want to eat lunch?

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:45.340
Let's see...

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:52.690
Hedges.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.890
Grandma said that they
have a connection

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.450
to the Other World, too.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:00.200
Tokine! The bench is open!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:00.960
Yeah.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.060
Huh?!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:06.400
Yoshimori?!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.040
Hurry up!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.140
I'm sorry. Can you go first?!

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.640
Uh... Sure...

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.320
What? I told you not to talk
to me at school

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.720
unless it's an emergency.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:21.890
It's about Grandma Toki.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.010
Grandma?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.420
Did you hear how she's going
to Black Pampas Grass?

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.130
Why do you want to know?

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.620
No reason...

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.630
Don't tell me you
want to follow her!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.760
I-It's not that!

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.660
Oh, it's that boy!

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:41.070
I knew that Tokine had someone!

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:44.410
I know exactly
what you're thinking!

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.970
The Other World is a scary place
like Lord Uro's realm.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.950
It rejects the living.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:55.420
You should know that
better than anyone.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.060
When you came back
from the Colorless Marsh,

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.360
I heard you cried like a baby.

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:02.160
Wh-Who told you?!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.530
Who cares?

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:04.530
Did you hear it from
Grandpa Shige?!

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.160
You heard it from him, didn't you?!

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:10.600
It's too dangerous for someone
as inexperienced as you.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.730
Just leave it to Grandma, okay?!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.810
Tokine!

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.680
Dummy!
You'll stretch out my sleeve!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.470
I have to do something!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:24.150
I have to follow Grandma Toki
and defeat Kaguro!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.080
That's the only way
I can avenge Shishio.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.960
No! You'll just get in her way!

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.160
I won't!

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.520
Kaguro is unusually strong!

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.290
You'll just get yourself killed!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.800
You want me to just cry myself
to sleep?!

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.600
Do you want to follow her
and end up dying?!

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.340
Just leave the passage to
the Kokuboro to Grandma.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.260
I just hope these will be enough.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:22.740
Excuse me...

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:32.080
You have some nerve
making me wait.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.890
What? The Chief got
called in by Ogi Ichiro?

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.660
A messenger came earlier.

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:48.960
I wonder what it is this time.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.960
Is he going to force
an impossible job on us again?

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:56.400
Chief...

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.840
You've mismanaged.

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:04.450
It seems an army of Ayakashi
called the Kokuboro

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.850
almost took over Karasumori.

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.590
And you still think that you are
the right one for this job?

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:14.620
How do you plan to take
responsibility for this?

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:18.070
It's true that we suffered a loss,

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.530
but it's because I dispatched
Shishio Gen there,

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:22.430
we were able to fight them off.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.500
I will not allow for anymore
casualties next time.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:25.800
Next time?!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:29.570
I will be moving the headquarters
of the Night Troops to Karasumori.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:32.040
How dare you!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.180
If our reinforcements had
made it on time,

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.170
we could've eradicated the enemy.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:40.480
That's why we will now conduct
our activities at Karasumori.

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.110
Who gave you permission?!

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:43.550
No one.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:48.920
I am the Chief of
the Night Troops. I decided it.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.590
I will not take orders
from anyone.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:56.230
You dare defy me?! Petty fool!

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:57.290
Do you want to fight then?

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.820
Such a cheater...

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:11.950
Trying to make me
incite something

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.940
at the Headquarters of
the Shadow Organization...

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:27.730
Fighting the ones from
the Other World head on, huh?

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:29.530
Suit yourself.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:33.970
It will be splendid if
they both kill each other off.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.980
- Welcome back, Chief.
- Welcome back, Chief.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.280
Get ready to move
our headquarters.

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:46.720
I've already asked for permission

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.280
from both the Sumimuras
and Yukimuras.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.210
What about the Shadow Organization?

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.420
Are you sure about this?

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:55.420
Don't worry about it!

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:56.560
Yes.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.600
Arrange to have equipment and
rations sent to both households.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:01.570
We will continue
our current work from there.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:05.770
Send out messengers to check
the progress at each location

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.930
and have them send in reports...

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.210
Even if this stirs up trouble,

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:13.410
no one will stop me from
this battle of revenge!

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.080
I'll be off then.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.550
Bye!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:21.820
Please be careful!

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:22.810
Sure thing.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.900
As expected,
Grandma Toki's a sharp one.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.740
But I'm going to
follow her unnoticed

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.680
all the way to Black Pampas Grass!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.190
I lost her!

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:56.180
What are you doing there?

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:07.730
Please! Take me to
Black Pampas Grass with you!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:12.960
No.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.910
W-Wait. Come on.
Aren't you even gonna ask me why?

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:23.350
This is a personal request
not as a Sumimura. Please.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.470
Hey! Hey!

00:15:26.850 --> 00:15:31.090
That hag! I said wait!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.060
I said wait!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:40.230
Listen to me...
Why, you!

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:42.100
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:46.470
Then how about... this huge one!

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:48.300
Sekkai!

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:53.810
That's to be expected from
the head of the Yukimura family!

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.150
So she's still strong enough to be
active on the frontlines, huh?

00:15:58.750 --> 00:15:59.410
My foot!

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:05.760
Hey! Hey, you! Please wait!

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.470
Don't think you can stop me
with that...

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:23.010
Did you think I couldn't
break that Kekkai?

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:27.640
I can find you easily with that
long stick you are carrying!

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:32.290
I don't want him
causing trouble in public.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.220
What should I do about him?

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:37.150
Taxi!

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.160
Please floor it to the station.

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:49.690
You want me to floor it?

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:50.500
Hurry!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:59.610
The station is right over there.
It's within walking distance.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:02.710
Then floor it to the next station!

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.180
So you want me to
floor it either way.

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:07.910
I knew this would happen,
so I brought this...

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.160
My secret weapon!

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.420
Wait!

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:20.530
See! I can just pull myself closer!

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.360
Driver! Turn left there!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:24.560
Sure thing.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:41.040
What?!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.020
Honestly, using Nenshi
for something like this!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.100
Go faster!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.670
I can't go any faster.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.270
Just do it.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.820
He's a persistent one.

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:10.180
Ma'am!

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.170
What is it?

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.390
Do you have your seatbelt on?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.320
What?!

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:33.730
That was close!
I thought I was going to die!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.010
He's so reckless.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.140
Driver, turn right up ahead.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.040
Sure thing!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.010
I got enough experience
on corners!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:45.650
This will be a piece of cake.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:21.750
What are you doing?

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:24.360
It's because you keep running
without listening to-

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.020
Kai!

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:29.180
Go home.

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.690
You'll catch a cold
if you stay wet.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.840
If you cannot even manage
your own health,

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:37.130
you cannot be considered
the Legitimate Heir.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:49.970
Please! Take me with you
to the Black Pampas Grass!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:55.950
I can't...
I heard what happened.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.530
I understand how you feel,

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:00.830
but if you intend on
taking over this duty,

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.460
you have to consider
what is most important.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:03.450
I don't intend on taking it over!

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:09.870
I'm going to seal
Karasumori one day

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:12.740
so no one has to
fight anymore.

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:18.370
I don't want anyone to
get hurt there ever again.

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:23.140
But I couldn't stop it again.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.350
At the very least,
I want to avenge Shishio!

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.880
Please! Take me with you!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.800
No. Not in the state
you are in now.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:46.630
You just want to satisfy yourself.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.030
Take a look.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.810
Since ancient times,
rivers and bridges were considered

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:58.310
to be boundaries that divided
this world and the Other World.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.560
To go to the Other World,

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:05.360
you must notice that boundary
and have the power to step over it.

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:11.300
But you can't even
see that entrance

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.130
to the Other World
under the bridge.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:19.400
At your level, you won't even
be able to come ashore.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.800
Wait a minute!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:27.740
What is this?

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.110
Damn it!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:33.180
No way! I can't move forward!
I can't get to shore!

00:21:35.220 --> 00:21:38.690
If you cannot reach the castle
without the help of others,

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:40.090
you should give up.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:44.730
Concentrate on protecting
Karasumori for now.

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:47.330
Think about how you can
make your powers truly yours.

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:49.390
Make them mine?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:52.310
If your powers control you instead,

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:53.800
you cannot be called
a full-fledged Caster.

00:21:55.180 --> 00:22:00.010
Right now... You still do not
understand how to use your powers.

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:15.320
How to use my powers?

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:22.990
I don't get it! Damn it!

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:46.260
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:52.960
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.530 --> 00:23:02.340
Joking around, I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:08.680
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:18.520
You don't have to say anything, it's okay

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:24.890
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:33.970
Straight ahead, I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:41.510
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:50.490
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:59.060
The red string connects one to another
